{"text": "August 3, 1982\n\nTO: R. A. Kampe\n\nSUBJECT: SALEM Status Report - Week Ending August 6\n\nI. Promotion\n\nSALEM Lights 100's and WINSTON Lights 85's will be\nthe featured brands for the August 16, 1982, BIGIF\nprogram. This program will be executed in the NA,\nSA, (excluding GS Test\n11 be placed in 408 of\nthe above-mentioned Sales Areas. All displays and\ngratis product have been produced and shipped to\ne field.\n\nII. Advertising Research\n\nA DAR test will be fielded August 16 on SALEM Spirit\nWinter campaign executions, \"Snowman\" (spread) and\n\u201cFour People Snowshoes\" (page). Topline will be\navailable the week of September 7 with final results\ndue the week of September 20.\n\nIII. Product Research\n\nCompetitive product test topline results on Kool\nLights 85's indicate that the improved SALEM\nLights 85's product proceeding to national manu-\nfacturing is at parity with Kool among all smoker groups.\n\nAmong total 18-24 year old competitive smokers,\nboth Merit, the current product competitor, and\nKool are superior to SALEM Lights 85's. The\nproduct competitors are at parity to each other.\n\nProduct testing results are. indicated below: - sti.\n\nKool Lights 85\n\nSALEM Lights 85\n\nMerit Mentho} 85",
